name: "go-tun2socks"
description:
    "lwIP-based TCP/UDP to proxy translation library. Vendored copy of "
    "upstream v1.16.11 so the lwIP TCP pcb double free can be fixed in the "
    "Go glue (core/tcp_conn.go, core/lwip.go) without waiting on a new "
    "release of golang.getoutline.org/sdk. Pulled in through the replace "
    "directive in the repository root go.mod. Upstream is archived; "
    "the long-term home for this fix is the OutlineFoundation fork."

